{%- comment -%}
  Bank Payment Checkout details form (Slice 2C task 2C-6,
  docs/specs/SLICE-2C-BANK-PAYMENT-CHECKOUT.md §5.3/§5.6, criteria 83-86,
  94-95, D20). Fixes the dead stub: previously every
  `data-carat-checkout-action="bank-payment"` button (main-cart-footer.liquid,
  cart-drawer.liquid, cart-notification.liquid) rendered, was announced, and
  did nothing — nothing handled the click. `theme/assets/bank-payment-
  checkout.js` (loaded unconditionally in layout/theme.liquid) is what wires
  this dialog open and POSTs its contents to `/apps/carat/bank-checkout`.

  RENDERED ONCE, GLOBALLY, OUTSIDE ANY RE-RENDERED CART SECTION. All three
  trigger buttons live inside sections the Section Rendering API swaps on a
  quantity change (main-cart-footer, CartDrawer/CartDrawerItems — see
  SLICE-2B-CART-SURFACE-INVENTORY.md D1/D2/L3). This dialog is not: it is
  rendered once in layout/theme.liquid, and `<modal-dialog>` (global.js)
  moves itself to `document.body` on connect. bank-payment-checkout.js opens
  it via a DOCUMENT-level delegated click listener on
  `[data-carat-checkout-action="bank-payment"]` rather than binding to a
  specific button element, so a section swap that re-injects a fresh copy of
  that button is still caught without rebinding — the same class of hazard
  L3 exists to catch, avoided here by construction rather than by a
  re-apply step.

  D20 — prefilled from `customer`/`customer.default_address` where present
  (Liquid's own signal for a logged-in session), never gated on it: a guest
  can fill this in and check out without an account. Nothing here is
  server-persisted by this snippet; Shopify's own `customer` object is the
  read, matching criteria 97-99's "read from Shopify, never duplicate".

  Criterion 84 — the not-committed disclosure is static, unconditional
  markup directly under the heading, so it is visible before any field is
  touched or the submit button is reached — never behind a link, accordion
  or tooltip.

  COPY STATUS: every `bank_payment_checkout_form.*` locale key below is a
  DRAFT pending owner approval (see the 2C-6 handoff). None is pinned in
  ownerApprovedCopy.test.ts yet — that happens only after sign-off, matching
  how the cancellation email's copy was handled in Slice 2C-b.
{%- endcomment -%}
<modal-dialog id="CaratBankCheckoutModal" class="carat-bank-checkout-modal">
  <div
    role="dialog"
    aria-labelledby="CaratBankCheckoutTitle"
    aria-modal="true"
    class="carat-bank-checkout-modal__content"
    tabindex="-1"
  >
    <div class="carat-bank-checkout-modal__header">
      <h2 id="CaratBankCheckoutTitle" class="carat-bank-checkout-modal__title h3">
        {{ 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.heading' | t }}
      </h2>
      <button
        id="ModalClose-CaratBankCheckoutModal"
        type="button"
        class="carat-bank-checkout-modal__toggle"
        aria-label="{{ 'accessibility.close' | t }}"
      >
        {{- 'icon-close.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
      </button>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%}
      Criterion 84: not-committed / not-guaranteed-until-verified disclosure.
      Always rendered, never `hidden`, ahead of every field — see this
      file's own header comment.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <p class="carat-bank-checkout-modal__disclosure" data-carat-bank-checkout-disclosure>
      {{ 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.not_committed_disclosure' | t }}
    </p>

    {%- comment -%}
      Error summary: JS populates this with a heading + a list of what
      failed and moves focus here on any submission failure (client
      validation or a server error code), per the accessibility requirement
      in the 2C-6 brief. `role="alert"` + `tabindex="-1"` matches
      contact-form.liquid's own error-heading pattern in this theme.
      Starts empty and hidden; never removed from the DOM, so JS only ever
      toggles `hidden` and sets `textContent`/`innerHTML` on the same node.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <div
      id="CaratBankCheckoutErrorSummary"
      class="carat-bank-checkout-modal__error-summary form-status-list"
      role="alert"
      tabindex="-1"
      hidden
      data-carat-bank-checkout-error-summary
    ></div>

    <form id="CaratBankCheckoutForm" novalidate data-carat-bank-checkout-form>
      <div class="carat-bank-checkout-modal__field field field--with-error">
        <input
          type="email"
          id="CaratBankCheckoutEmail"
          name="email"
          class="field__input"
          autocomplete="email"
          spellcheck="false"
          autocapitalize="off"
          required
          placeholder="{{ 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.email_label' | t }}"
          value="{{ customer.email | escape }}"
          aria-describedby="CaratBankCheckoutEmail-error"
        >
        <label class="field__label" for="CaratBankCheckoutEmail">
          {{- 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.email_label' | t }}
          <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label
        >
        <small
          id="CaratBankCheckoutEmail-error"
          class="carat-bank-checkout-modal__field-error form__message"
          hidden
          data-carat-bank-checkout-field-error
        >
          <span class="svg-wrapper">{{- 'icon-error.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}</span>
          <span data-carat-bank-checkout-field-error-text></span>
        </small>
      </div>

      <div class="carat-bank-checkout-modal__field-row">
        <div class="carat-bank-checkout-modal__field field">
          <input
            type="text"
            id="CaratBankCheckoutFirstName"
            name="firstName"
            class="field__input"
            autocomplete="given-name"
            placeholder="{{ 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.first_name_label' | t }}"
            value="{{ customer.default_address.first_name | escape }}"
          >
          <label class="field__label" for="CaratBankCheckoutFirstName">
            {{- 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.first_name_label' | t -}}
          </label>
        </div>
        <div class="carat-bank-checkout-modal__field field">
          <input
            type="text"
            id="CaratBankCheckoutLastName"
            name="lastName"
            class="field__input"
            autocomplete="family-name"
            placeholder="{{ 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.last_name_label' | t }}"
            value="{{ customer.default_address.last_name | escape }}"
          >
          <label class="field__label" for="CaratBankCheckoutLastName">
            {{- 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.last_name_label' | t -}}
          </label>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="carat-bank-checkout-modal__field field field--with-error">
        <input
          type="text"
          id="CaratBankCheckoutAddress1"
          name="address1"
          class="field__input"
          autocomplete="address-line1"
          required
          placeholder="{{ 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.address1_label' | t }}"
          value="{{ customer.default_address.address1 | escape }}"
          aria-describedby="CaratBankCheckoutAddress1-error"
        >
        <label class="field__label" for="CaratBankCheckoutAddress1">
          {{- 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.address1_label' | t }}
          <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label
        >
        <small
          id="CaratBankCheckoutAddress1-error"
          class="carat-bank-checkout-modal__field-error form__message"
          hidden
          data-carat-bank-checkout-field-error
        >
          <span class="svg-wrapper">{{- 'icon-error.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}</span>
          <span data-carat-bank-checkout-field-error-text></span>
        </small>
      </div>

      <div class="carat-bank-checkout-modal__field field">
        <input
          type="text"
          id="CaratBankCheckoutAddress2"
          name="address2"
          class="field__input"
          autocomplete="address-line2"
          placeholder="{{ 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.address2_label' | t }}"
          value="{{ customer.default_address.address2 | escape }}"
        >
        <label class="field__label" for="CaratBankCheckoutAddress2">
          {{- 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.address2_label' | t -}}
        </label>
      </div>

      <div class="carat-bank-checkout-modal__field-row">
        <div class="carat-bank-checkout-modal__field field field--with-error">
          <input
            type="text"
            id="CaratBankCheckoutCity"
            name="city"
            class="field__input"
            autocomplete="address-level2"
            required
            placeholder="{{ 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.city_label' | t }}"
            value="{{ customer.default_address.city | escape }}"
            aria-describedby="CaratBankCheckoutCity-error"
          >
          <label class="field__label" for="CaratBankCheckoutCity">
            {{- 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.city_label' | t }}
            <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label
          >
          <small
            id="CaratBankCheckoutCity-error"
            class="carat-bank-checkout-modal__field-error form__message"
            hidden
            data-carat-bank-checkout-field-error
          >
            <span class="svg-wrapper">{{- 'icon-error.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}</span>
            <span data-carat-bank-checkout-field-error-text></span>
          </small>
        </div>
        <div class="carat-bank-checkout-modal__field field">
          <input
            type="text"
            id="CaratBankCheckoutProvince"
            name="provinceCode"
            class="field__input"
            autocomplete="address-level1"
            maxlength="10"
            placeholder="{{ 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.province_label' | t }}"
            value="{{ customer.default_address.province_code | escape }}"
          >
          <label class="field__label" for="CaratBankCheckoutProvince">
            {{- 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.province_label' | t -}}
          </label>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="carat-bank-checkout-modal__field-row">
        <div class="carat-bank-checkout-modal__field field field--with-error">
          <input
            type="text"
            id="CaratBankCheckoutZip"
            name="zip"
            class="field__input"
            autocomplete="postal-code"
            required
            placeholder="{{ 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.zip_label' | t }}"
            value="{{ customer.default_address.zip | escape }}"
            aria-describedby="CaratBankCheckoutZip-error"
          >
          <label class="field__label" for="CaratBankCheckoutZip">
            {{- 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.zip_label' | t }}
            <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label
          >
          <small
            id="CaratBankCheckoutZip-error"
            class="carat-bank-checkout-modal__field-error form__message"
            hidden
            data-carat-bank-checkout-field-error
          >
            <span class="svg-wrapper">{{- 'icon-error.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}</span>
            <span data-carat-bank-checkout-field-error-text></span>
          </small>
        </div>
        <div class="carat-bank-checkout-modal__field field field--with-error">
          <label class="field__label" for="CaratBankCheckoutCountry">
            {{- 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.country_label' | t }}
            <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label
          >
          <div class="select">
            <select
              id="CaratBankCheckoutCountry"
              name="countryCode"
              class="select__select"
              autocomplete="country"
              required
              aria-describedby="CaratBankCheckoutCountry-error"
            >
              {% render 'bank-checkout-country-options', selected_country_code: customer.default_address.country_code %}
            </select>
            <span class="svg-wrapper">{{- 'icon-caret.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}</span>
          </div>
          <small
            id="CaratBankCheckoutCountry-error"
            class="carat-bank-checkout-modal__field-error form__message"
            hidden
            data-carat-bank-checkout-field-error
          >
            <span class="svg-wrapper">{{- 'icon-error.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}</span>
            <span data-carat-bank-checkout-field-error-text></span>
          </small>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="carat-bank-checkout-modal__field field">
        <input
          type="tel"
          id="CaratBankCheckoutPhone"
          name="phone"
          class="field__input"
          autocomplete="tel"
          placeholder="{{ 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.phone_label' | t }}"
          value="{{ customer.default_address.phone | escape }}"
        >
        <label class="field__label" for="CaratBankCheckoutPhone">
          {{- 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.phone_label' | t -}}
        </label>
      </div>

      <div class="carat-bank-checkout-modal__actions">
        <button type="submit" class="button" data-carat-bank-checkout-submit>
          {{ 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.submit' | t }}
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="button button--secondary" data-carat-bank-checkout-dismiss>
          {{ 'sections.cart.bank_payment_checkout_form.cancel' | t }}
        </button>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%}
        Non-error status (submitting / success / redirecting). Kept distinct
        from the error summary above (`role="status"`, not `role="alert"`) —
        same reasoning as the Card Checkout reprice notice elsewhere in this
        theme: an in-progress or successful submission is not a warning.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <p
        id="CaratBankCheckoutStatus"
        class="carat-bank-checkout-modal__status form-status"
        role="status"
        aria-live="polite"
        hidden
        data-carat-bank-checkout-status
      ></p>
    </form>
  </div>
</modal-dialog>
